BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 50 547.5 Td (  16-character Network ID.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 50 534.0 Td (- Agree on ONE config/cluster.env for the team. It is gitignored, so share it in your team) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 10 Tf 50 520.5 Td (  chat. The values must be identical on all four nodes.) Tj ET
